sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Repo as ChatRepository
    participant SSOT as Room (Ch 3)
    participant Out as Outbox (Ch 31)
    participant WS as WebSocket/REST (Ch 63)
    participant Srv as Server (truth)

    User->>Repo: send("hi")
    Repo->>SSOT: insert {clientId, status=Sending} (optimistic, Ch 72)
    Repo->>Out: enqueue {clientId, body}
    Out->>WS: send {clientId as idempotency key} (Ch 15)
    WS->>Srv: deliver
    Srv-->>WS: ack {clientId, serverSeq, ts}
    WS->>SSOT: update {clientId -> status=Sent, serverSeq} (re-sort)
    Note over Out,Srv: offline -> outbox retries. idempotency dedups
